  "content": "\n\n<h1><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1171134/description_933258d2-3bd4-465f-a26a-a5f242349e43.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"262\"></strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fanimated-item-textures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/Ccjrt9Xj?style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&labelColor=333333&color=00AF5C\" alt=\"\" width=\"160\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flinktr.ee%252fxivill\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1171134/description_fabf2047-5cab-499b-b6c4-44b2a2734901.png\" alt=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/animated-item-textures\" width=\"160\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>如需发光效果，请安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a>！</strong></p>\n<h1><strong>资源包内容：</strong></h1>\n<hr>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eLRlXDs.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"484\"></h2>\n<p><strong>ShivaKlans 的动态纹理</strong> 为《我的世界》注入了活力，它通过为 42 种常用物品添加动画，</p>\n<p>同时保留了游戏原有的经典风格。未来的更新还将带来更多惊喜！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong>在此查看动画：</strong></h1>\n<hr>\n<p>（此处仅为 GIF 动图演示。游戏中的实际纹理质量和流畅度要好得多）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UYLLKrh.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"260\" height=\"520\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/00Cx1eR.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"260\" height=\"526\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IlujABz.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"260\" height=\"522\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Y98yzHk.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"260\" height=\"523\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uMWLZoX.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"260\" height=\"520\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XfQmiAa.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"260\" height=\"523\"></p>",
